  "question": {
    "text": "The voltage of clouds is <math><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> with respect to ground. In a lightning strike lasting <math> <mrow> <mtext>100&nbsp;ms</mtext></mrow> </math>, a charge of <math> <mrow> <mtext>4&nbsp;C</mtext></mrow> </math> is delivered to the ground. The average power of lightning strike is (assume complete discharges )"
